{# Values of the theme form (Layout → Themes → Gestaltung) as CSS variables, from DesignVariables::of(): the tokens of a chosen style first, the fields of the form after them, so a value changed by hand wins. Loaded in the <head> of every page with a layout of the theme. Values are raw: DesignVariables only holds normalized colors, fixed options and style values without ";", braces or "<". #}
<style nonce="{{ csp_nonce('style-src') }}">.nw-theme { {% for variable, value in variables %}{{ variable }}: {{ value|raw }}; {% endfor %}}</style>
